IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `tma-types`
IMPORT `tma-returns`
IMPORT `tma-payment`
IMPORT `tma-time-limits`
IMPORT `tma-goal`

-- Taxes Management Act 1970 (UK) — the encoder's tests. Expected values are
-- worked by hand from the Act. Tax year 2024 is 2024-25.

§ `Tests`

GIVEN notice IS A MAYBE DATE, electronic IS A BOOLEAN, delivered IS A MAYBE DATE, amended IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Return facts`
`a 2024-25 return, notice` notice `, electronic` electronic `, delivered` delivered `, amended` amended MEANS
    `Return facts` OF 2024, notice, electronic, delivered, amended

usual MEANS `a 2024-25 return, notice` (JUST (Date 6 4 2025)) `, electronic` TRUE `, delivered` (JUST (Date 20 1 2026)) `, amended` NOTHING

§§ `Goal 1 — returns`

#ASSERT `the last day to notify chargeability for` usual EQUALS Date 5 10 2025
#ASSERT `the filing deadline for` usual EQUALS JUST (Date 31 1 2026)
#ASSERT `the filing deadline for` (`a 2024-25 return, notice` (JUST (Date 6 4 2025)) `, electronic` FALSE `, delivered` NOTHING `, amended` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 31 10 2025)
-- Exception 1: notice 15 August 2025 — paper within 3 months (14 November),
-- electronic by 31 January.
#ASSERT `the filing deadline for` (`a 2024-25 return, notice` (JUST (Date 15 8 2025)) `, electronic` FALSE `, delivered` NOTHING `, amended` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 14 11 2025)
#ASSERT `the filing deadline for` (`a 2024-25 return, notice` (JUST (Date 15 8 2025)) `, electronic` TRUE `, delivered` NOTHING `, amended` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 31 1 2026)
-- Exception 2: notice 30 November 2025 — 3 months: 28 February 2026 (no 30
-- February).
#ASSERT `the filing deadline for` (`a 2024-25 return, notice` (JUST (Date 30 11 2025)) `, electronic` TRUE `, delivered` NOTHING `, amended` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 28 2 2026)
#ASSERT `the filing deadline for` (`a 2024-25 return, notice` NOTHING `, electronic` TRUE `, delivered` NOTHING `, amended` NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 9ZA: twelve months after 31 January 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day to amend the return for` usual EQUALS Date 31 1 2027
#ASSERT `the last day to amend the return for` (`a 2024-25 return, notice` (JUST (Date 30 11 2025)) `, electronic` TRUE `, delivered` NOTHING `, amended` NOTHING) EQUALS Date 28 2 2027
-- s 9A: on time (20 January 2026): 20 January 2027.
#ASSERT `the last day for a notice of enquiry for` usual EQUALS JUST (Date 20 1 2027)
-- Late (10 March 2026): anniversary 10 March 2027, next quarter day 30 April
-- 2027.
#ASSERT `the last day for a notice of enquiry for` (`a 2024-25 return, notice` (JUST (Date 6 4 2025)) `, electronic` TRUE `, delivered` (JUST (Date 10 3 2026)) `, amended` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 30 4 2027)
-- Amended 1 August 2026: anniversary 1 August 2027, quarter day 31 October.
#ASSERT `the last day for a notice of enquiry for` (`a 2024-25 return, notice` (JUST (Date 6 4 2025)) `, electronic` TRUE `, delivered` (JUST (Date 20 1 2026)) `, amended` (JUST (Date 1 8 2026))) EQUALS JUST (Date 31 10 2027)
-- An anniversary on a quarter day: the next one (31 July → 31 October).
#ASSERT `the quarter day next following` (Date 31 7 2027) EQUALS Date 31 10 2027
#ASSERT `the quarter day next following` (Date 1 11 2027) EQUALS Date 31 1 2028

§§ `Goal 2 — payment`

-- Fields: year, previous assessed, previous deducted, prescribed minimum,
-- prescribed proportion, self-assessed, paid on account, deducted, notified
-- in time, notice date.
pay MEANS `Payment facts` OF 2024, 8000, 2000, 1000, 0.2, 9000, 6000, 1000, TRUE, JUST (Date 6 4 2025)
#ASSERT `payments on account are due under` pay
#ASSERT `each payment on account under` pay EQUALS 3000
#ASSERT `the first payment on account date for` pay EQUALS Date 31 1 2025
#ASSERT `the second payment on account date for` pay EQUALS Date 31 7 2025
#ASSERT `the balancing payment under` pay EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `the balancing payment date for` pay EQUALS Date 31 1 2026
-- Below the prescribed amount; below the proportion (80% deducted).
#ASSERT NOT (`payments on account are due under` (`Payment facts` OF 2024, 1800, 1000, 1000, 0.2, 0, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING))
#ASSERT NOT (`payments on account are due under` (`Payment facts` OF 2024, 10000, 8100, 1000, 0.2, 0, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING))
#ASSERT `each payment on account under` (`Payment facts` OF 2024, 10000, 8100, 1000, 0.2, 0, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING) EQUALS 0
-- s 59B(3): notified in time, notice on 30 November 2025: 28 February 2026.
#ASSERT `the balancing payment date for` (`Payment facts` OF 2024, 0, 0, 1000, 0.2, 500, 0, 0, TRUE, JUST (Date 30 11 2025)) EQUALS Date 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `the balancing payment date for` (`Payment facts` OF 2024, 0, 0, 1000, 0.2, 500, 0, 0, FALSE, JUST (Date 30 11 2025)) EQUALS Date 31 1 2026
-- A repayment.
#ASSERT `the balancing payment under` (`Payment facts` OF 2024, 0, 0, 1000, 0.2, 500, 600, 100, TRUE, NOTHING) EQUALS 0 MINUS 200
-- s 59B(6): notice 10 March 2026 — due 9 April 2026.
#ASSERT `the due date for an assessment notified on` (Date 10 3 2026) EQUALS Date 9 4 2026

§§ `Goal 3 — assessment time limits`

#ASSERT `the last day for an assessment for` 2024 `where the loss is` `no loss brought about by the taxpayer` EQUALS Date 5 4 2029
#ASSERT `the last day for an assessment for` 2024 `where the loss is` `careless` EQUALS Date 5 4 2031
#ASSERT `the last day for an assessment for` 2024 `where the loss is` `involving an offshore matter or transfer` EQUALS Date 5 4 2037
#ASSERT `the last day for an assessment for` 2024 `where the loss is` `deliberate, a section 7 failure, or a scheme disclosure failure` EQUALS Date 5 4 2045

§§ `The top-level goal`

pos MEANS `the self-assessment position for` (`Self-assessment case` OF usual, pay, `careless`)
#ASSERT pos's `filing deadline` EQUALS JUST (Date 31 1 2026)
#ASSERT pos's `each payment on account` EQUALS 3000
#ASSERT pos's `balancing payment date` EQUALS Date 31 1 2026
#ASSERT pos's `last day for an assessment` EQUALS Date 5 4 2031
